{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00859","headline":"鼓吹曲辞 战城南二首 一 · 僧贯休","name":"鼓吹曲辞 战城南二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里桑乾傍，茫茫古蕃壤。\n将军貌顦顇，抚劒悲年长。\n胡兵尚陵逼，久住亦非强。\n邯郸少年辈，个个有伎俩。\n拖枪半夜去，雪片大如掌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00859.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00859","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}